# 8g: the keeper is started again in the middle of a run. The same panes come
# back with their variables, so a worker's command still knows its attempt;
# for two minutes nobody is declared gone, not even an agent that left.
fixture evening-2114

orch: status --sweep --quiet
restart-terminals
clock +5s
orch: status --sweep --quiet
as-worker T2.1: progress 60 "still here"
term-drop gone T3
clock +5s
orch: status --sweep --quiet
clock +100s
orch: status --sweep --quiet
orch: wait --timeout 0                 -> expect No event yet
assert: attempts T1.1 working, T2.1 asked, T3.1 working, T7.1 reported; T3 status running failures 0; no event lost; no event twice
